      "statement": "The bootstrap flow writes the root certificate to pki.GetRootCAPath() with mode 0600 and the authority configuration to step.DefaultsFile() with mode 0644, creating parent directories with 0700 and storing ca-url, fingerprint, root, and optionally redirect-url, provisioner, and min-password-length.",
